{
  "name": "ordinario-rivalsa-withholding",
  "description": "Worked example (b). Ordinario, INPS Gestione Separata with rivalsa, Italian business client (withholding agent): fees €1,000.00 (VAT 22 %); rivalsa 4 % × 1,000.00 = €40.00; VAT 22 % × 1,040.00 = €228.80; withholding 20 % × (1,000.00 + 40.00) = €208.00 (the rivalsa is subject to withholding: FatturaPA Ritenuta SI). No amount outside VAT, so no stamp duty. Total 1,040.00 + 228.80 = €1,268.80; net payable 1,268.80 − 208.00 = €1,060.80.",
